  {
    "id": "anno-kanbe_upper_p109_right-06",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "但シ子年ヨリ五ヶ年ノ内寅辰兩年格外凶作ニ付相除キ前戌亥兩年差入平均仕候"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "但し、子年より五ヶ年のうち、寅・辰の両年は格外の凶作につき相除き、前の戌・亥の両年を差し入れて平均仕り候"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Note: of the five years counted from the year of the Rat, the Tiger and Dragon years were exceptionally poor harvests and were therefore struck out; the earlier Dog and Boar years were substituted in computing the average."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "但書（凶作二年除外平均）"
      }
